<body>
  <header><a class="brand" href="/"><span></span>StockTap</a><nav><a href="/problems/">Problems we fix</a><a href="/videos/">Videos</a><a href="/guides/">Guides</a><a href="/auth">Sign in</a></nav></header>
  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Busy weekends catch me short</span>
        <h1>Order for the busy weekend, not an average one.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A normal week&#x27;s order won&#x27;t get you through a bank holiday, a big match or December. StockTap lets you plan for the week you&#x27;re actually about to have.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/auth?mode=signup" data-cta="problem-busy-weekends-top">Start free</a><a class="btn2" href="/#tour">Watch the tour</a>
        <p class="note">14 days of Pro free, no card. Cancel any time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="phone"><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/media/poster-orders-promo.jpg" src="/media/stocktap-orders-promo.mp4" aria-label="Ordering for busy periods"></video></div>
    </div>
    <h2>How StockTap sorts it</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><b>Choose how long the order has to last</b><p>Slide from 3 to 28 days. The order grows to cover it.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>Say how busy it&#x27;ll be</b><p>Normal, +10%, +25% or +50%. Every line scales with it.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>Or copy a real busy period</b><p>Add your older audits and StockTap shows your takings per day for each one. Tap Christmas, or your busiest spell, and the order is built on what you actually sold then.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>It learns your pattern</b><p>Each line shows a small chart of how it sold across your audits, so you can see what spikes and what doesn&#x27;t.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><b>Still your call</b><p>Change any line with + and − before you send it.</p></div>
    </div>
    <h2>What you need</h2>
    <div class="need">Today this uses your Venners audits: the latest one, plus older ones for the pattern. Not with Venners? Raise your par levels for the week and the order guide follows.</div>
    <div class="cta">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px">Try it on your own bar</h2>
      <p style="color:#8A9099">14 days of Pro free, no card. Cancel any time. Your phone is all you need to start.</p>
      <a class="btn" style="margin-top:14px" href="/auth?mode=signup" data-cta="problem-busy-weekends-bottom">Start free</a>
    </div>
    <h2>Other things StockTap sorts</h2>
    <div class="more">
      <a href="/problems/what-to-order">I never know what to order →</a>
      <a href="/problems/stocktake-down">My stocktake says I&#x27;m down →</a>
      <a href="/problems/checking-deliveries">Deliveries take ages to check →</a>
      <a href="/problems/postmix">Postmix never adds up →</a>
      <a href="/problems/venners-audit">Got a Venners audit? →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="author">Written by Shaun McManus, licensee in Washington, Tyne &amp; Wear, who built StockTap to run behind his own bar.</p>
  </main>
  <footer><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/problems/">Problems we fix</a><a href="/videos/">How-to videos</a><a href="/guides/">Guides</a><a href="/tools/">Free tools</a><a href="mailto:hello@stocktap.net">hello@stocktap.net</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></footer>
